		"description": {
			"en": "One tone-on-tone leafy branch of broad-leaved montane shrub foliage fills the right third of the sheet from top to bottom.",
			"zh": "一枝山地问阔叶自右缘进入，自上而下铺满右侧三分之一，与纸面同一调子。"
		},
		"motif": "Tone-on-tone broad leaves, thin stems and small buds, read as a pressed herbarium specimen barely separated from the paper.",
		"rationale": "Hexly brand-texture rules give animal identities a botanical surface drawn from the animal's real habitat. Chamelo's mark is a chameleon that lives in montane shrub and tree foliage, so the surface is broadleaf habitat foliage in the same right-column placement and low-chroma leaf palette as the other animal cards."
